# ==========================================================================
# .assetsignore — files EXCLUDED from the Cloudflare Workers asset upload
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The build uses Output Directory "." (the repo root), so without this file
# Wrangler tries to upload the ENTIRE repo as static assets — including the
# .git history, whose pack file is ~49 MiB and exceeds Cloudflare's 25 MiB
# per-asset limit. These entries keep repo/dev files out of the deploy so only
# the actual website is served.
# ==========================================================================

# Version control history (the cause of the "Asset too large" error).
.git
.git/**

# Repo / config files that are not part of the served site.
.gitignore
.nojekyll
README.md
_redirects
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.toml
node_modules

# Local docs / reference material (not part of the live site).
docs
docs/**
